DCR05 *** --------------------------------------------------------
DCR05 *** THIS ROUTINE WAS PREVIOUSLY CODED TO DISPLAY ERROR
DCR05 *** MESSAGES ONLY WHEN ASSOCIATED WITH A SCREEN FIELD.
DCR05 *** (IE: FIELD NUMBER HAD TO BE > 0 AND RI/PC WAS "ON")
DCR05 *** MESSAGE FIELD WAS ONLY DISPLAYED(IN99 = B"1") WHEN A
DCR05 *** FIELD ERROR OCCURED. CHANGE FOR DCR05 WAS MADE TO
DCR05 *** ACCOMODATE DISPLAYING A MESSAGE NOT RELATED TO A SPECIFIC
DCR05 *** SCREEN FIELD ERROR    (IE: INVALID FUNCTION KEY)
DCR05 *** --------------------------------------------------------

DCR05 *** --------------------------------------------------------
DCR05 *** EDIT FIELD NUMBER TO PREVENT SUBSCRIPT ERROR WHEN = ZERO
DCR05 *** --------------------------------------------------------
DCR05      IF  FIELD-NUMBER > ZERO
DCR05      AND FIELD-NUMBER < 100
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(FIELD-NUMBER), IND(99)
DCR05      END-IF.

           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER  TO DE1-MESSAGE-LINE,
                                   DE2-MESSAGE-LINE,
                                   DE3-MESSAGE-LINE,
