139600*                                               *
139700*   OPEN, READ, AND CLOSE REQ-DATE-SEQ-FILE     *
139800*   WHICH CONTAINS THE SEQ. RANGE OF REQ. NO.   *
139900*   OF THE LAST 5 TIMES THE REQ. CREATE PROGRAM *
140000*   RAN SO THE USER CAN PROCESS BY DATE. THE    *
140100*   REASON THE FILE IS OPENED AND CLOSED BEFORE *
140200*   AND AFTER THE READ IS SO THIS PROGRAM DOES  *
140300*   NOT HAVE OWNERSHIP OF THE FILE DURING THE   *
140400*   THE ENTIRE TIME THE PROGRAM IS RUNNING      *
140500*   ONLY WHEN IT NEEDS TO EDIT THE DATE         *
140600*   THE REASON MPLTINFO IS LOCKED BY "PREQ" KEY *
140700*   IS TO PREVENT THIS PROGRAM AND THE REQ      *
140800*   CREATE PROGRAM FROM SIMULTANEOUSLY          *
140900*   ACCESSING REQ-DATE FILE IN WHICH CASE ONE   *
141000*   OF THE PROGRAMS WOULD HAVE BLOWN OFF        *
141100*                                               *
141200*************************************************
