DCR01          MOVE REQITM-CORP-CODE(1:SAVE-ARIBA-LENGTH)
DCR01                                      TO MCODEFILTER-ARG
DCR01
DCR01          MOVE MCODEFILTER-ARG TO CORPCDE  OF MCODE-FILTER-REC
DCR01          READ MCODE-FILTER
DCR01          END-READ
DCR01
DCR01          IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
DCR01              SET CODE-FILTER-FND-YES  TO TRUE
DCR01          END-IF
DCR01
DCR01      END-IF.
