DCR01 *----------------------------------------------------------------

VER25 **************************************************
VER25 *                                                *
VER25 *   GET THE CODES FROM THE CATALOG FILE NOW      *
VER25 *   TO DETERMINE IF THIS IS AN ARIBA ITEM.       *
VER25 *   IF FOUND SET CODE-FILTER-FND-SW = 'Y'        *
VER25 *   THIS WILL REPLACE READING THE COMMODITY      *
VER25 *   CODE FILE.                                   *
VER25 * ---- COMMENTED OUT FOR NOW -----               *
VER25 **************************************************
VER25 *    SET CODE-FILTER-FND-NO TO TRUE.
VER25 *    IF ARIBA-ENABLED-YES
VER25 *        MOVE REQITM-CORP-CODE TO CORPCDE OF DARIBACAT-REC-I
VER25 *
VER25 *        READ DARIBACAT-I
VER25 *        END-READ
VER25 *
VER25 *        IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
VER25 *            SET CODE-FILTER-FND-YES TO TRUE
VER25 *        END-IF
VER25 *    END-IF.

           IF TRM-FROM-MAJ-GRP = SPACES
               GO TO 64-CHECK-FOR-BLANKETS
DCR01      END-IF.


           IF REQITM-CORP-CODE-1-2 NOT < TRM-FROM-MAJ-GRP

               IF REQITM-CORP-CODE-1-2 NOT > TRM-TO-MAJ-GRP
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   PERFORM 641-UNLOCK-MREQ
                   GO TO 64-PR-X
DCR01          END-IF

           ELSE
               PERFORM 641-UNLOCK-MREQ
               GO TO 64-PR-X
DCR01      END-IF.

190300 64-CHECK-FOR-BLANKETS.
190400
190500********************************************
190600*                                          *
190700*  CHECK IF THIS CODE IS ON A BLANKET BY   *
190800*  CALLING SUBROUTINE 'TCHKBLKT'. IT WILL  *
190900*  RETURN FOUR PIECES OF INFORMATION       *
191000*    1) TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT IS THE TOTAL   *
191100*     NUMBER OF BLANKETS THAT EXIST BOTH   *
191200*     UNEXPIRED AND EXPIRED.               *
191300*    2) UNEXPIRED-BLKT-COUNT IS THE TOTAL  *
191400*     NUMBER OF UNEXPIRED BLANKET ORDERS   *
191500*     THAT EXIST.                          *
191600*    3) FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLKT CONTAINS THE  *
191700*     ACTUAL PO NUMBER OF THE FIRST        *
191800*     UNEXPIRED BLANKET THAT IS FOUND.     *
191900*    4) CHKBLKT-QTY-ON-DOCK CONTAINS       *
192000*       QTY ON DOCK AND NOT STORED IN THE  *
192100*       STOREROOM UM.                      *
192200********************************************
192300
           MOVE SPACES TO R11-SMALL-PO, R11-LARGE-PO.
           MOVE COMPANY-SAVE TO COMPANY-ID.
192400     CALL "TCHKBLKT" USING BASE,
192500                           CODE-ARG,
192600                           CHKBLKT-PARMS.
192700     IF COMPANY-SAVE-1-2 = "11"
192800         IF TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT > ZEROS
192900             MOVE AKRON-BLKT-MSG   TO  DISP-BLKT-MSG
193000         ELSE
193100             MOVE SPACES           TO  DISP-BLKT-MSG
193200     ELSE
193300     IF UNEXPIRED-BLKT-COUNT = ZEROS
193400         IF TRM-REQUIRE-OPTION = "X"
193500             PERFORM 641-UNLOCK-MREQ
193600             GO TO 64-PR-X
193700         ELSE
193800             MOVE SPACES           TO  DISP-BLKT-MSG
193900     ELSE
194000     IF UNEXPIRED-BLKT-COUNT = 1
194100         MOVE F4-RELEASE-MSG       TO  DISP-BLKT-MSG
194200     ELSE
194300         MOVE TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT  TO  F1-BLK-NO
194400         MOVE F1-RELEASE-MSG       TO  DISP-BLKT-MSG.
194500
194600     IF TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT > 0
194700         MOVE "Y"                  TO  F4-VALID-SW
194800     ELSE
194900         MOVE "N"                  TO  F4-VALID-SW.
195000
DCR01 *----------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01 *--- ARIBA PROCESSING
DCR01 *    ARIBA OVERRIDE MESSAGE FOR ARIBA AND F4 NOT ALLOWED
VER23 *    COMMENTED OUT SEVERAL LINES - F4 ALLOWED -
VER23 *    DUE TO INVENTORY REPLENISHMENT
DCR01 *----------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01      IF CODE-FILTER-FND-YES
VER23          MOVE "Y"         TO  F4-VALID-SW
VER23          IF TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT > 0
VER23 *            *** DISPLAY CATALOG AND REQUIREMENT ORDER MSG ***
VER23              MOVE ARIBA-CAT-REQ-MSG TO DISP-BLKT-MSG
VER23          ELSE
VER23 *            *** DISPLAY CATALOG MSG ***
VER23              MOVE ARIBA-CATALOG-MSG TO DISP-BLKT-MSG
VER23          END-IF
DCR01      END-IF.
