VER23 **--------------------------------------------------------------
VER23 **-- WE WILL NOW LOG THIS AS AN EXCEPTION BY CALLING
VER23 **-- SUBROUTINE 'SRSNCDPF' AND DISPLAYING A SET OF STANDARD
VER23 **-- EXCEPTION CODES TO CHOOSE FROM.
VER23 **--------------------------------------------------------------
VER23          INITIALIZE EXCEPTION-NO, EXCEPTION-REASON
VER23          CALL "SRSNCDPF" USING EXCEPTION-NO,
VER23                                EXCEPTION-REASON
VER23          IF EXCEPTION-NO = "EXIT"
VER23 *            *** USER MADE MISTAKE AND PRESS 'f3' TO EXIT ***
VER23              MOVE SPACES TO TRM-HOLD-OPTION
VER23              GO TO 64-WRITE-SCREEN-2
VER23          ELSE
VER23 *            *** USER WANTS TO BY-PASS ARIBA - FLAG EXCEPTION ***
VER25              MOVE "Y" TO BYPASS-ARIBA-SW
VER23              SET ARIBA-ENABLED-NO TO TRUE
DCR04              GO TO 64-GET-MREQ
VER23          END-IF
DCR04      END-IF.
