310200*
310300*  THIS ROUTINE ADDS UP ALL OUTSTANDING REQ.
310400*  QUANTITIES ON OTHER REQUISITIONS FOR THE SAME
310500*  CORPORATE CODE.  FOR THE REQUISITION TO QUALIFY
310600*  IT MUST NOT BE ON A P.O. A REQ. STATUS OF
310700*  'XX' MEANS THE REQ. HAS BEEN PLACED ON A PO
310800*  IF REQ-HOLD-STATUS = 'BATCHFILE' THEN THE
310900*  REQ IS CLOSED BUT IS STILL IN THE BATCH FILE FOR
311000*  SHIPPING RELEASE THEREFORE INCLUDE ITS QTY.
311100*  IN THE REQ. ONORDER QTY.
311200*
311300******************************************************
311400
311500 641-GET-REQ-ONORDER.
312200     MOVE ZEROS  TO  SAVE-REQ-ONORDER.
