313700             MOVE CODE-ARG              TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
313800             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           IF CORPCDE OF DREQITMC-REC-I NOT = CODE-ARG
312900         IF SAVE-REQ-ONORDER = ZEROS
313000             MOVE SPACES      TO  DISP-REQ-ONORDER-X
313100             GO TO 641-GRO-X
313200         ELSE
313300             MOVE SAVE-REQ-ONORDER  TO  DISP-REQ-ONORDER
313400             GO TO 641-GRO-X.
