316100**
316200**   THIS ROUTINE CALCULATES THE TOTAL QUANTITY IN THE
316300**   THE BATCH SHIPPING RELEASE FILE 'DSHIPREL' FOR
316400**   A CODE NOT ON A REQUISITION
316500**
316600*******************************************************
316700
316800 641-GET-BATCH-RLSE-QTY.
316900     MOVE ZEROS                   TO  SAVE-PENDING-RLSE.
      *    MOVE SPACES TO DLYTCDTE OF DSHIPREL-REC-I.
           MOVE SPACES TO DATECYMD OF DSHIPREL-REC-I.
      *    START DSHIPREL-I KEY >= DLYTCDTE OF DSHIPREL-REC-I
           START DSHIPREL-I KEY >= DATECYMD OF DSHIPREL-REC-I
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   MOVE "START DSHIPREL*641-GBRQ" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
