               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
324000         MOVE "FIND DREQITM*641-CR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
324100         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           READ DREQITM-O NEXT INTO BUF-DREQITM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" OR
              REQNO OF DREQITM-REC-O NOT = REQ-ARG
324500         MOVE "GET DREQITM*641-CR"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
324600         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
324700
324900**************************************************
