332400*                                                *
332500*   FIND AND GET ALL DREQQUE ENTRIES AND         *
332600*   DELETE                                       *
332700*                                                *
332800**************************************************
332900 641-FIND-DREQQUE.
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO REQNO OF DREQDESC-REC-O.
           START DREQDESC-O KEY > REQNO OF DREQDESC-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE REQ-ARG TO REQNO OF DREQQUE-REC-O.
           START DREQQUE-O KEY = REQNO OF DREQQUE-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   GO TO 641-UNLOCK-DREQQUE
               ELSE
333300             MOVE "FIND DREQQUE *641-FD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
333400             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
333500
333600 641-GET-DREQQUE.
           READ DREQQUE-O NEXT INTO BUF-DREQQUE
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14"
                   GO TO 641-UNLOCK-DREQQUE
               ELSE
                   MOVE "READ DREQQUE * 641-GD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           IF REQNO OF DREQQUE-REC-O NOT = REQ-ARG
               GO TO 641-UNLOCK-DREQQUE.
