367800*                                                *
367900*   IF FREE VERBAGE IS SELECTED FOR THE REQ.     *
368000*   THIS SCREEN IS BROUGHT UP SO THE USER CAN    *
368100*   KEY UP TO 8 LINES OF FREE VERBAGE FOR PRINT  *
368200*   PURPOSES ONLY                                *
368300*                                                *
368400**************************************************
368500
368600 644-FREE-VERBAGE.
368700     MOVE "FREQUPDT6"  TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
369300     MOVE SPACES  TO  SCREEN-6.
