369500     MOVE BUILD-REQ-NO       TO  DISP-SCREEN6-REQ-NO.
369600     MOVE CORP-CODE          TO  DISP-SCREEN6-CODE.
369700     CALL "CREQREM" USING BASE,
369800                          BASE-MMISA,
369900                          STATUS-AREA,
370000                          BUF-DREQD,
370100                          REQ-STATUS,
370200                          CREQREM-REMARKS,
370300                          BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
370400     IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
370500         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
370600     MOVE CREQREM-REMARKS         TO  TRM-FREE-VERBAGE.
