           MOVE SCREEN-6       TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-6.
373900
375200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
375300         GO TO 644-FV-X
375400     ELSE
375500     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
375600        VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
375700        VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
375800        VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
375800        VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
375900        VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
376000        VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
