376300         MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
376400         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
376500         MOVE 99  TO  FIELD-NUMBER
376600         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU 4-PGM-ERROR-X
376700         GO TO 644-READ-SCREEN-6.
