      *    *** NOW PROCESSING ***
pdr   *    MOVE  14 TO LANG-SETNUM.
pdr   *    MOVE   2 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
pdr   *    PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
pdr   *    MOVE B"1" TO IND (98).
pdr   *    MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE6-COMMAND-LINE.
pdr   *    PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN.
pdr   *    PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN.
pdr   *    MOVE B"0" TO IND (98).
pdr   *    PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN.

