382600         PERFORM 6442-DELETE-DREQDESC.
382700
382800     GO TO 6441-GET-DREQDESC.
382900
383000 6441-UPDATE-DREQDESC.
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO REQNO OF DREQDESC-REC-O.
           START DREQDESC-O KEY > REQNO OF DREQDESC-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
383100     MOVE SPACES                  TO  BUF-DREQDESC.
383200     MOVE REQ-ARG                 TO  REQDESC-REQ-NUMBER.
383300     MOVE "0001"                  TO  REQDESC-ITEM-NO.
383400     IF TRM-FREE-VERBAGE-LINE (1)  NOT = SPACES
383500         MOVE "95"                TO  REQDESC-LINE-NO
383600         MOVE TRM-FREE-VERBAGE-LINE (1) TO REQDESC-DATA
383700         PERFORM 6442-PUT-REMARKS.
383800
383900     IF TRM-FREE-VERBAGE-LINE (2)  NOT = SPACES
384000         MOVE "96"                TO  REQDESC-LINE-NO
384100         MOVE TRM-FREE-VERBAGE-LINE (2) TO REQDESC-DATA
384200         PERFORM 6442-PUT-REMARKS.
