386800******************************************************
386900*
387000*  THIS PROCEDURE MAKES A PART RESERVATION. IT IS ONLY
387100*  USED IF THE REQUISITION WAS A MMIS REQUISITION.
387200*  AFTER THE RESERVATION IS MADE THE REQUISITION IS
387300*  CANCELLED
387400*
387500******************************************************
387600
387700 645-RESERVE-PART.
387800     MOVE "N"                   TO  EDIT-ERR-SW.
387900     MOVE SPACES                TO  CRESERVE-PARMS.
388000     MOVE "RS"                  TO  RESV-TYPE.
388100     MOVE CODE-ARG              TO  RESV-CORP-CODE.
388200     MOVE DISP-WO-NUM           TO  RESV-WO-NO.
388300     MOVE DREQD-WO-ITM-NO       TO  RESV-WO-ITEM-NO.
388400     MOVE TRM-REQ-QTY           TO  RESV-QTY.
388500     MOVE REQ-STAGING-AREA      TO  RESV-STAGE-LOC.
388600     MOVE REQ-FOR-DEPT          TO  RESV-USE-DEPT.
388700     MOVE SAVE-REQ-DATE-WANT-YMD  TO  RESV-DATE.
           IF RESV-DATE = SPACES
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF RESV-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO RESV-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO RESV-DATE-CC.
388800     CALL "CRESERVE" USING BASE,
388900                           BASE-MMISA,
389000                           CRESERVE-PARMS,
389100                           CRESERVE-ERROR-MESSAGE,
389200                           VIEW-COMAREA,
389300                           LANGUAGE-PARMS.
389400     IF RESV-RET-CODE = "OK"
389500         GO TO 645-RESERVE-COMPLETE
389600     ELSE
389700         MOVE "Y"  TO  EDIT-ERR-SW
389800         MOVE CRESERVE-ERROR-MESSAGE  TO  MESSAGE-BUFFER
389900         MOVE 93 TO  FIELD-NUMBER
390000         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
390100         GO TO 645-RP-X.
390200
390300 645-RESERVE-COMPLETE.
390400     PERFORM 641-CANCEL-REQ  THRU  641-CR-X.
390500
390600 645-RP-X.
390700     EXIT.
390800
390900
391000*****************************************************
391100*                                                   *
391200*   CALL 'TREQINTF' TO CONVEY THE STATUS OF THE     *
391300*   REQUISITION TO THE WORK ORDER.  THREE STATUS    *
391400*   CODES ARE PASSED 1) 'CA' REQ. CANCELLED         *
391500*    2) 'HD' REQ. IS ON HOLD  3) 'IP' IN PURCHASING *
391600*                                                   *
391700*****************************************************
391800
391900 645-CALL-TREQINTF.
392000     CALL "TREQINTF" USING BASE-MMISA,
392100                           MMIS-REQ-STATUS-PARMS,
392200                           STATUS-AREA.
392300     IF COND-WORD = 0 OR 15 OR 17
392400         NEXT SENTENCE
392500     ELSE
392600         MOVE "ERR IN TREQINTF " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
392700         MOVE DREQD-WO-NUMBER    TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
392800         MOVE DREQD-WO-ITM-NO    TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
392900         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
393000
393100 645-CT-X.
393200     EXIT.
